      "content": "HIGH STREET 1. 5252                                                   (East Side)                                                   No 25 TL 0507 1/150 II                       GV 2. Early C19.  Red brick, hipped old tiled roof with modillioned cornice.  3 storeys, tall Corinthian pilasters to angles of upper floors.  1st floor has 2 triple light sash windows in surrounds.  Modern shop with C19 cornice. Nos 25, 27 and 29 form a group. Listing NGR: TL0559407765"
